                  learning of displacement fields and mass variations.
                  Experiments show that MUST-FM reduces computational overhead
                  while achieving robust and biologically meaningful trajectory
                  inference, enabling dynamic modeling of atlas-scale
                  single-cell datasets.}
}

@ARTICLE{Huguet2022-pz,
