  eprinttype   = {arXiv},
  eprintclass  = {cs.LG},
  abstract     = {Many machine learning tasks such as multiple instance
                  learning, 3D shape recognition, and few-shot image
                  classification are defined on sets of instances. Since
                  solutions to such problems do not depend on the order of
                  elements of the set, models used to address them should be
